OL,5,G2145 An Actor's Life: Ralph Fiennes
OL,6,     FA five-part conversation between
OL,7,     FNeil Dudgeon and Ralph Fiennes.
OL,8,     FHere, they discuss Fiennes's work
OL,9,     Fwith Robert Redford, and
OL,10,     FShakespeare, his lodestone.
